  <p>
    Authier keeps its smaller feature set in a compact, dark workspace with
    passwords, TOTP codes, devices, and security controls close together.
    Bitwarden’s interface reflects its broader scope, with separate areas for
    vaults, organizations, reports, imports, exports, and settings.
  </p>

